{"metadata":{"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"双纤维化"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"双纤维化"},0]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>异态射</strong> (heteromorphism)\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Het}(x,y):= \\operatorname{Hom}(f_! x,y) = \\operatorname{Hom}(x,f^*y).\r\n$$</p>\n"}}